Subject: [PATCH v12 3/4] ring-buffer: Skip invalid sub-buffers when rewinding persistent ring buffer
Date: Tue, 24 Mar 2026 09:00:29 +0900
Message-ID:  <177431042885.3708637.5943717865815136744.stgit@mhiramat.tok.corp.google.com>
X-Mailer: git-send-email 2.53.0.983.g0bb29b3bc5-goog
